  "what": "For each board, sha256 of every source file its freeze, resolve and judging scripts load (followed through imports), as installed on the production host at issued_utc, and a board fingerprint = sha256 over the sorted 'file:sha256' lines. The code itself is private.",
  "how_it_is_used": "A daily check compares the installed code with the latest fingerprint and alerts on any difference. Any change to that code is published as a new dated fingerprint disclosure; a change that alters forecasts also gets a new model_version and, where a sealed standard requires it, a new standard or addendum before it is used.",
